menu "mybips printer gateway"

    config BIPS_DEVELOPMENT_MODE
        bool "Enable unprovisioned printer testing and development-only password recovery"
        default n
        help
            This mode permits manual printing without a provisioned eFuse identity
            and permits GPIO4 to restore the shared initial password. It is unsafe
            for production. Disable it in a production configuration; printing
            then fails closed until the certificate-bound identity and recovery
            flow are implemented and verified.

endmenu
